.DS_Store
DSL/vscode-extension/node_modules/
DSL/vscode-extension/*.vsix
Deprecated/*

node_modules/

# Rust/Cargo
**/target/
Cargo.lock

# Build output
**/dist/

# Env files
.env
.env.*

# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific, never shared)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Graphify
graphify-out/

# Dogfood — throwaway artifacts a skill-under-test generates (kept local, never committed).
# The dogfood's value (.behavior/.description, EXPRESSIVENESS.md, BRIEF.md) IS committed.
dogfood/**/examples/

tmp/

# Clone-local vibe-ops configuration. Layers over the committed vibeops.config.ts and holds what is true
# of one clone on one machine — an operator's plugin path, a personal artifact location. A machine path
# committed into the tracked config is what the `machine-paths` check exists to catch.
vibeops.config.local.ts
vibeops.config.local.mjs
vibeops.config.local.js

# Written by `vibe-ops harness sync`: which template version this clone was promulgated to, and which
# ownership boundary it agreed to. State about a working tree, not a product of it — committing it would
# turn every promulgation into a diff in a file the repository owns.
vibeops.config.local.json
